sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant Creator as Run creator
    participant Control as Control PostgreSQL
    participant Objects as Storage adapter
    participant Local as Execution PostgreSQL
    Caller->>Creator: Profile and dataset source or finalized upload ID
    opt Inline or file dataset
        Creator->>Objects: Bounded resumable ingestion and verified catalog publication
    end
    Note over Creator,Control: Reuse finalized dataset and frozen plan inputs<br/>Recheck plan existence when no frozen inputs are available
    Creator->>Control: Atomically record run identity, frozen inputs and execution intent
    loop Verified dataset batches
        Creator->>Objects: Read and verify index and complete case file
        Creator->>Creator: Validate cases, fold chunk identity and gate counts
        opt Bounded chunk-file group ready
            Creator->>Control: Register every exact key under creation lease
            Creator->>Objects: Create or reconcile files, verify complete bytes
            Creator->>Control: Atomically acknowledge verified contiguous prefix
        end
    end
    loop Remaining chunks, index levels, gates, configuration and manifest
        Creator->>Control: Register bounded file group before remote writes
        Creator->>Objects: Create and verify files in dependency order
        Creator->>Control: Atomically acknowledge verified group or prefix
    end
    Creator->>Control: Check references, outstanding objects and manifest together
    Creator->>Control: Publish verified root, compact shard metadata and release lease atomically
    alt Preparation only
        Creator->>Control: Read current status, error and progress in one snapshot
        Creator-->>Caller: Creating, plan ready, execution held
    else Execution requested
        Creator->>Control: Claim creation authority for admission
        Creator->>Objects: Recovery reads roots and gate counts under its lease
        Note over Creator,Objects: Foreground creation reuses already verified roots
        loop Bounded chunk pages
            Creator->>Objects: Read verified ordered chunk page
            loop Bounded placement operations
                Creator->>Control: Resolve current placement serviceability
                Creator->>Local: Lock shard fences in order, batch snapshots and chunks
                Local-->>Creator: Commit exact replayable metadata
            end
            Creator->>Control: Acknowledge contiguous admission progress
        end
        loop Ordered verification pages per execution database
            Creator->>Control: Resolve current placement serviceability
            Creator->>Local: Read bounded chunk page and admission state
            Creator->>Creator: Fold and compare each shard identity independently
        end
        Creator->>Control: Read shard totals, hashes and aliases together
        Creator->>Control: Fenced activation, publish routes and cursors and release lease atomically
        Creator->>Control: Read current status, error and progress in one snapshot
        Creator-->>Caller: Current status and progress
    end
    Note over Creator,Control: Admission renews by elapsed time<br/>Checkpoints and activation check live authority
    Note over Creator,Control: Coordinators resume requested admission after lease release or expiry
    Note over Creator,Control: Deferred work and errors attempt fenced release<br/>Confirmed commits need no extra release; process death uses expiry
